{"title": "Vital Conduit", "pageid": 28484, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vital_Conduit", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Vital Conduit</b> is a passive feature that provides bonus healing when casting a concentration spell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Grants the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"8 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> when they cast a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">Spell</a> that requires <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a>. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Can only have temporary hit points from one source.</span></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_.288.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_(8)\"> Condition: Temporary Hit Points (8) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(8)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (8) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporary Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(8)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (8) (Condition)\">Temporary Hit Points</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Kept from death's door by a brief magical boost. Gained <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"8 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vital_Conduit_Boots\" title=\"Vital Conduit Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Boots_Metal_Githyanki_Magic_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Vital_Conduit_Boots\" title=\"Vital Conduit Boots\">Vital Conduit Boots</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Vital Conduit</b> is triggered even by casting concentration cantrips, like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike\" title=\"True Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-True_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-True_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike\" title=\"True Strike\">True Strike</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Cantrip)\" title=\"Resistance (Cantrip)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/25px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/38px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/50px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/25px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Cantrip)\" title=\"Resistance (Cantrip)\">Resistance</a>.</li>\n<li>Vital Conduit is not triggered by most concentrations spells allowing free recast. Tested with: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/25px-Hex_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/38px-Hex_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/50px-Hex_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/25px-Hex_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\">Hex</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/38px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/50px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunter's Mark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\">Hunter's Mark</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/25px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/38px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/50px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/25px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\">Moonbeam</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal\" title=\"Heat Metal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Metal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal\" title=\"Heat Metal\">Heat Metal</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Call_Lightning\" title=\"Call Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Call Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Call_Lightning\" title=\"Call Lightning\">Call Lightning</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/38px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/50px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampiric Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\">Vampiric Touch</a>.</li>\n<li>The exception known to trigger this ability multiple times is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/25px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/38px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/50px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloudkill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/25px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\">Cloudkill</a>. It is possible to move the cloud every turn without expending spell slots and trigger this ability.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204835\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3507/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29781/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12112/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1064915/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   65.517      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   65.517      1 -total\n 38.13%   24.984     12 Template:Icon_text\n 32.62%   21.372     33 Template:Trim\n 26.66%   17.469     11 Template:Icon_link\n 24.29%   15.914      9 Template:SAI\n 18.25%   11.956     14 Template:Ifempty\n 14.23%    9.323      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 13.51%    8.853      1 Template:Temp_hp\n 11.08%    7.257      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28484-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714204835 and revision id 370172. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}